    {
      "source": "Static factory method to create an <a href=\"ObservationHandlerGroup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.micrometer.observation.autoconfigure\"><code>ObservationHandlerGroup</code></a> with members of\nthe given handler type.",
      "translation": "用于创建具有给定处理程序类型的成员的<a href=\"ObservationHandlerGroup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.micrometer.observation.autoconfigure\"><code>ObservationHandlerGroup</code></a>的静态工厂方法。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Group of <code>ObservationHandlers</code> that can be registered\ntogether. The first group claiming membership of a handler is responsible for\nregistering it. Groups are <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Comparable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Comparable</code></a> so that they can be ordered against each\nother.",
      "translation": "一组可以一起注册的 `ObservationHandlers`。第一个声明拥有该处理器成员资格的一组负责注册它。这些组实现了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Comparable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Comparable</code></a>，以便它们可以相互排序。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Register group members against the given <code>ObservationRegistry.ObservationConfig</code>.",
      "translation": "针对给定的<code>ObservationRegistry.ObservationConfig</code>注册组成员。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the primary type of handler that this group accepts.",
      "translation": "返回该组接受的处理程序的主类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return if the given handler is a member of this group.",
      "translation": "如果给定的处理器是该组的成员，则返回。",
      "count": 2
    },
